---
source: crates/forgejo-core/src/error/render.rs
expression: "snap(ErrorKind::Forbidden\n{ server_message: \"user is not a collaborator on this repository\".into() },\nctx())"
---
error: permission denied (HTTP 403)

  request:     POST /api/v1/repos/perf3ct/fcli/issues
  server says: user is not a collaborator on this repository
  token from:  the OS keyring, entry fcli:git.example.org

what to do:
  the server denied this action. Check the message and your account permissions.
  1. fcli api user --jq .login  (confirm who you are)
  2. ask for the access you need, or, as an instance admin, act as
     someone who has it with --sudo <user>
